{
  // Tool descriptions for lcp-mcp-tasks. Each tool is mode-gated — call the
  // one matching your assignment's mode. Call describe_server first for details.
  "describe_server": "Returns an overview of the tasks service and the tool you must use to complete your assignment, tailored to your current mode.",
  "create_plan": "PLAN MODE ONLY. Submits the plan for your task: an ordered list of assignments, each with a prompt, a role to carry it out, its expected outputs, and optional materials. You MUST call this as your final action — a narrated plan is not accepted. Call describe_server first for the exact shape of each assignment.",
  "complete_assignment": "IMPLEMENT MODE ONLY. Submits your finished assignment: a concise summary plus the artifacts you prepared (assignment-working-path files and/or inline text). Your prepared artifacts must satisfy the assignment's expected outputs — files are verified to exist. You MUST call this as your final action after the work is done.",
  "assure_assignment": "QA MODE ONLY. Records your QA verdict on the assignment under review: accept it, or reject it with actionable feedback for the implementing agent. Feedback is required when rejecting. You MUST call this as your final action."
}
